# The only difference between the bench's two builds of this node.

config BENCH_DCDC_HONOUR_LIMIT_IMMEDIATELY
	bool "Apply a reduced pack allowance immediately"
	default y
	help
	  When set, a reduction in BMS_Limits.AuxCurrentLimit takes effect at
	  once, and only increases in pack draw are rate-limited. The rate cap
	  protects the contactors and the input filter from inrush, which a
	  reduction does not cause.

	  When unset, the cap applies in both directions, so the converter
	  approaches a reduced allowance gradually instead of obeying it. Every
	  frame it sends remains legal and in range while it does.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
